VALUES ('811736d0-f49f-5304-a15b-69ef7cf8efc4', 'Consignment', 'Maintain Consignment records', 'Create, find and maintain Consignment records. The list shows every Consignment you have access to — select a row to open it, or use New to add one. Each row is a single Consignment, described by 2 fields.

