VALUES ('5019675d-3bcb-584c-88df-d9062ec728bf', 'bus_freight_charge', 'Freight Charge', 'A governed monetary charge for transportation or logistics services attributable to a shipment, consignment, load, or carrier service. Provide canonical implementation-neutral semantics for FreightCharge across enterprise applications. A governed monetary charge for transportation or logistics services attributable to a shipment, consignment, load, or carrier service. Used in CRM, sales, fulfillment, logistics, reporting, integration, or audit processes where this concept applies. Connects to canonical parties, commercial transactions, logistics execution, and downstream evidence without replacing their authoritative records. Created and progressed through governed business workflow; completed history is retained and corrections are explicit. Commercial management, fulfillment, logistics execution, reconciliation, reporting, and audit. Enterprise sales and supply-chain operations.', 'A', FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, '69f74ba9-2ff2-5a60-bd2d-b9d3704202fd', 'U', TRUE, 'system', 'system', NOW(), NOW())
